    - target: {fileID: 4646935935515841261, guid: 6083a81f48d944a6ea2593f892ce8ab1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Type words to collect flowers.


        You do not need to worry about
        capitalization. Just type the word.


        You can sell the flowers for
        <sprite name="coin"> coins at any time by pressing <b>return</b>.


        When
        selling, you get a bonus based on speed and accuracy.


        You can then
        use the <sprite name="coin"> coins to buy rarer flowers that will sell for
        more <sprite name="coin"> coins.'
